  "description": "Nalix.Common defines the fundamental abstractions, enums, and shared contracts\nfor the Nalix ecosystem. It provides base interfaces, environment helpers,\nserialization primitives, and protocol definitions used across all Nalix modules.\n\nThis library focuses on performance, consistency, and cross-platform reliability —\nserving as the foundation for higher-level components such as Nalix.Framework,\nNalix.Network, Nalix.SDK, Nalix.Shared, and Nalix.Logging.",
